   "source": "community",
   "text": "Warriors of all types <snort> have need of a strong spirit. It drives you to greater feats when all hope has been lost. This is not unknown to the <snort> Razormane. We are a spiritual tribe--we are more proud of our connection to Agamaggan than our prowess <snort> in battle.\n\nBring me 4 blood shards and I will bless your spirit for battle. <snort>",
